WEBVTT

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.918
Doctor!

00:01:47.942 --> 00:01:50.434
Where were you?!

00:01:51.545 --> 00:01:54.571
Out big-game hunting.

00:02:00.721 --> 00:02:02.120
Scalpel.

00:02:08.896 --> 00:02:12.476
This is Dr. Shinogi's
so-called "dance”.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.612
It's a special technique he invented,
despite being in his 20s,

00:02:15.636 --> 00:02:19.249
that is based on everything
we know about anatomy.

00:02:19.273 --> 00:02:22.786
--Stitch him up.
--Right.

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:27.357
It doesn't even take him 30 minutes
to remove cancer that has spread.

00:02:27.381 --> 00:02:29.893
He's truly gifted.

00:02:29.917 --> 00:02:31.762
Brother...!

00:02:31.786 --> 00:02:35.766
| hear you're Hanma Baki's
next opponent...!

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.815
Are you seriously going to fight him?!

00:02:43.531 --> 00:02:44.942
Kosho...

00:02:44.966 --> 00:02:50.928
"The Two Titans Clash!"

00:02:58.946 --> 00:03:03.026
Brother. I don't resent Hanma Baki...

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:08.231
In fact, I feel grateful
for my fight with him.

00:03:08.255 --> 00:03:11.034
--But if you--
--Kosho...

00:03:11.058 --> 00:03:16.440
You're gravely mistaken
if you think I'm avenging you.

00:03:16.464 --> 00:03:20.877
| simply wish to test my
research results in the fighting world.

00:03:20.901 --> 00:03:22.733
Research results...?

00:03:25.706 --> 00:03:30.821
The perfect body. My own body
is my greatest masterpiece!

00:03:30.845 --> 00:03:35.292
A heavyweight boxer's explosiveness.
A sprinter's mobility.

00:03:35.316 --> 00:03:40.931
An amateur wrestler's flexibility.
And a marathon runner's endurance...

00:03:40.955 --> 00:03:43.333
The ultimate body with those abilities,

00:03:43.357 --> 00:03:46.870
clashing head-on with the
"greatest” martial artist.

00:03:46.894 --> 00:03:49.740
Would you not like to see that, Kosho?

00:03:49.764 --> 00:03:53.176
Your body is already
at a superhuman level.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.412
It's even more dangerous
than Cord-Cutting.

00:03:55.436 --> 00:03:57.014
What?!

00:03:57.038 --> 00:03:59.182
This homo?!

00:03:59.206 --> 00:04:01.698
--Please stop, Mr. Vale!
--Outta the way!

00:04:04.245 --> 00:04:09.359
| hear you're the only lap
who can power-lift over a ton.

00:04:09.383 --> 00:04:11.361
Whadya say to a benching contest?

00:04:11.385 --> 00:04:12.896
...-Missy.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.615
Why, you...!

00:04:15.623 --> 00:04:17.567
Those are low-level muscles.

00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:19.202
What?!

00:04:19.226 --> 00:04:21.438
They're the worst possible kind-

00:04:21.462 --> 00:04:24.808
they're meant for show
instead of functionality.

00:04:24.832 --> 00:04:27.911
You know who you're talkin' to?!

00:04:27.935 --> 00:04:33.339
Such muscles would tire out
after washing just one window.

00:04:35.709 --> 00:04:38.822
--How dare you...!
--Kosho!

00:04:38.846 --> 00:04:43.927
You will tell the police that your
brother was about to be killed...

00:04:43.951 --> 00:04:47.546
I'll shut that big mouth
of yours for good...!

00:04:49.523 --> 00:04:52.083
A sprinter's mobility...!

00:04:56.197 --> 00:04:58.859
A heavyweight boxer's explosiveness...!

00:05:07.374 --> 00:05:09.786
An amateur wrestler's flexibility...!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:14.611
That was close.
I could have been killed.

00:05:16.917 --> 00:05:21.718
Baki's going to fight
this man tomorrow...?!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.194
"Orochi”

00:05:59.193 --> 00:06:02.873
Orochi Doppo...
Fifty-five as of this year...

00:06:02.897 --> 00:06:05.575
Strength, speed, stamina, technique...

00:06:05.599 --> 00:06:09.229
This may be the last year
I can stay at my peak...

00:06:12.606 --> 00:06:15.303
Thank you for lasting long enough!

00:06:17.578 --> 00:06:19.022
Natsue...

00:06:19.046 --> 00:06:21.324
You're staring at the mirror...

00:06:21.348 --> 00:06:23.193
Have a new girlfriend?

00:06:23.217 --> 00:06:25.117
Don't be silly...!

00:06:28.122 --> 00:06:31.034
How long has it been
since you rinsed like that?

00:06:31.058 --> 00:06:33.670
Long before you had your dojos,

00:06:33.694 --> 00:06:36.606
you used to rinse off at daybreak...

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:39.442
Always on the days of your matches...

00:06:39.466 --> 00:06:42.979
Do you think I'm going to lose?

00:06:43.003 --> 00:06:47.201
Of course not.
"Cannibal Orochi” never loses!

00:06:52.913 --> 00:06:54.711
Well, I'm off.

00:06:57.685 --> 00:06:59.414
Doppo-chan...

00:07:02.089 --> 00:07:04.922
You're my Superman...!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.415
When I come home victorious...

00:07:18.439 --> 00:07:21.033
...maybe I'll caress your behind.

00:07:37.725 --> 00:07:40.604
After this, Doppo Orochi and the crowd

00:07:40.628 --> 00:07:45.395
will know why Yujiro
is called the Ogre...

00:07:46.233 --> 00:07:51.648
--You must be very conflicted.
--Eh? Why's that?

00:07:51.672 --> 00:07:54.050
On the day you have sworn victory,

00:07:54.074 --> 00:07:57.220
you must pray for
your father's defeat...

00:07:57.244 --> 00:08:00.490
However, you are the champion.

00:08:00.514 --> 00:08:04.712
| ask that you
concentrate on your own fight.

00:08:06.987 --> 00:08:10.667
Please forgive my uncalled-for remarks.

00:08:10.691 --> 00:08:12.750
Thanks, Matsuo-san...

00:08:16.196 --> 00:08:18.358
You're so gallant, Doppo!

00:08:22.436 --> 00:08:25.148
Orochi-sensei. It's time.

00:08:25.172 --> 00:08:26.970
It's finally time?!

00:08:31.178 --> 00:08:33.923
Thank you all for waiting!

00:08:33.947 --> 00:08:37.994
Today there will be two great showdowns
at the Korakuen arena!

00:08:38.018 --> 00:08:41.531
Hanma Yujiro versus Orochi Doppo

00:08:41.555 --> 00:08:46.102
and Hanma Baki versus Shinogi Kureha!

00:08:46.126 --> 00:08:51.189
In the Seiryu corner,
the God of War, Orochi Doppo!

00:09:01.575 --> 00:09:03.600
Orochi-sensei...

00:09:21.328 --> 00:09:26.343
Here he is! Cannibal Orochi,
Legendary God of War, Tiger Killer...

00:09:26.367 --> 00:09:30.280
The man who's gone by many titles,
Orochi Doppo!

00:09:30.304 --> 00:09:33.483
Doppo! Doppo! Doppo!

00:09:33.507 --> 00:09:36.586
Doppo! Doppo! Doppo!

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:40.023
Doppo! Doppo! Doppo!

00:09:40.047 --> 00:09:43.278
Wonderful! This is so exciting!

00:09:44.418 --> 00:09:47.285
Doppo's pretty awesome too...!

00:09:48.389 --> 00:09:51.301
What's with you?
You're awfully uninterested.

00:09:51.325 --> 00:09:54.904
No, it's just that
he's fighting the Ogre.

00:09:54.928 --> 00:09:57.158
I'm not sure how he'll fare...

00:10:01.335 --> 00:10:07.172
In the Byakko corner,
the challenger, Hanma Yujiro!

00:10:10.911 --> 00:10:13.490
There he is!

00:10:13.514 --> 00:10:15.725
The world's strongest being...

00:10:15.749 --> 00:10:19.447
--Ogre. I'll take your shirt.
--Sure.

00:10:25.559 --> 00:10:30.507
A surprise attack! The Legendary
God of War uses a surprise attack!

00:10:30.531 --> 00:10:32.898
Let the match begin!

00:10:34.902 --> 00:10:40.350
Hey, now! The Shinshinkai's supposed
to teach kids morals and stuff,

00:10:40.374 --> 00:10:42.318
but its manager resorts to this?!

00:10:42.342 --> 00:10:45.655
Fool! There are no rules in fighting!

00:10:45.679 --> 00:10:48.671
The bastard hasn't changed one bit...!

00:10:51.618 --> 00:10:56.466
Surprised, Ogre? This is the
infamous Orochi-Style Karate...

00:10:56.490 --> 00:11:00.136
The springs in your legs stopped
my body of over 100 kilograms...

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.561
Allow me to commend you.

00:11:08.635 --> 00:11:10.467
He's coming this way!

00:11:15.676 --> 00:11:18.373
Whoa! They're airborne...!

00:11:44.605 --> 00:11:45.748
Whoa...!

00:11:45.772 --> 00:11:47.450
Payback for that heel-drop?!

00:11:47.474 --> 00:11:49.252
That's my Doppo!

00:11:49.276 --> 00:11:53.623
Incredible...! Such speed,
such fighting spirit!

00:11:53.647 --> 00:11:56.259
This is truly the
world's greatest battle!

00:11:56.283 --> 00:11:59.028
How will Hanma Yujiro retort?!

00:11:59.052 --> 00:12:02.215
How will Orochi Doppo attack?!

00:12:18.071 --> 00:12:20.984
The greatest battle in
the history of the arena!

00:12:21.008 --> 00:12:23.500
Who will be the next to attack?!

00:12:25.512 --> 00:12:27.207
This is the greatest.

00:12:30.317 --> 00:12:32.547
This is the greatest night.

00:12:35.055 --> 00:12:36.633
What is Hanma doing?!

00:12:36.657 --> 00:12:40.637
He's begun walking around
like he's out for a stroll!

00:12:40.661 --> 00:12:44.495
--What's his deal?!
--It can't be! That walk...!

00:12:52.239 --> 00:12:54.817
Run, Doppo! Get out of there!

00:12:54.841 --> 00:12:56.519
Get out of there! Doppo!

00:12:56.543 --> 00:12:59.522
What is Motobe fussing about?

00:12:59.546 --> 00:13:02.659
Does he know what Yujiro is up to?

00:13:02.683 --> 00:13:04.227
Doppo!

00:13:04.251 --> 00:13:09.712
How annoying. I know very well
that is no normal walk...

00:13:11.825 --> 00:13:17.594
But I won't stand down. My karate
doesn't know how to retreat...!

00:13:28.742 --> 00:13:30.232
What?!

00:13:38.318 --> 00:13:42.312
He's down! Orochi Doppo has fallen!

00:13:47.127 --> 00:13:48.253
"Seiryu Locker Room"

00:13:54.601 --> 00:13:57.901
It would seem one of them has fallen.

00:14:03.443 --> 00:14:05.888
What exactly happened?!

00:14:05.912 --> 00:14:11.661
To us, it looked like Hanma
had approached him defenselessly!

00:14:11.685 --> 00:14:15.131
| wouldn't expect anyone to know!

00:14:15.155 --> 00:14:16.432
What?!

00:14:16.456 --> 00:14:18.868
-It's "Udonde".
--Udonde?

00:14:18.892 --> 00:14:21.270
Properly known as "Udundi”...

00:14:21.294 --> 00:14:24.540
A secret martial art passed
down only to the eldest sons

00:14:24.564 --> 00:14:26.709
of the Ryukyu royal family!

00:14:26.733 --> 00:14:30.213
Its greatest characteristic, its walk,
is said to be indomitable.

00:14:30.237 --> 00:14:34.584
In it, the median line is maintained
with absolutely no side-swaying.

00:14:34.608 --> 00:14:37.053
As a result, there are no openings.

00:14:37.077 --> 00:14:40.890
This forces the enemy
to attack recklessly.

00:14:40.914 --> 00:14:44.460
I'd heard he had mastered
all manners of fighting,

00:14:44.484 --> 00:14:47.296
but the secret Ryukyu style...?!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.654
And he's Baki's old man?
He's some bastard...!

00:14:54.428 --> 00:14:57.955
He's up! Orochi Doppo
continues to fight!

00:15:00.367 --> 00:15:03.146
That was quite interesting, Ogre...

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:08.017
| had always hoped to experience
the secret royal technique...

00:15:08.041 --> 00:15:11.654
If you're tough enough,
| can show it to you plenty more!

00:15:11.678 --> 00:15:12.922
No thanks.

00:15:12.946 --> 00:15:15.142
Seeing it once is enough!

00:15:20.287 --> 00:15:22.465
The Maeba Stance?!

00:15:22.489 --> 00:15:25.652
Ah! So he's using that!

00:15:43.009 --> 00:15:44.943
Their dominance zones touched!

00:15:50.684 --> 00:15:52.662
He stopped...!

00:15:52.686 --> 00:15:56.247
What's he doing?!
He's completely inside his zone!

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.690
Impressive, Orochi!

00:16:15.976 --> 00:16:19.689
--How deplorable.
--Eh?

00:16:19.713 --> 00:16:24.427
As you are now, you are
unqualified to enter the ring.

00:16:24.451 --> 00:16:31.100
| have waited on great kings
since the 30th year of Showa,

00:16:31.124 --> 00:16:36.172
but you are the first one I have
ever seen to lack such focus.

00:16:36.196 --> 00:16:40.565
Watching you any further
will be difficult.

00:16:42.002 --> 00:16:43.993
Wait, Matsuo-san...

00:16:47.407 --> 00:16:52.054
Luckily, that was an old fool's punch...

00:16:52.078 --> 00:16:54.056
Forgive my incivility, Baki-sama!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:58.347
But you will die if you fight Kureha!

00:16:59.186 --> 00:17:03.199
Matsuo-san. I'm--

00:17:03.223 --> 00:17:05.191
"Byakko Locker Room"

00:17:07.394 --> 00:17:11.174
Brother... Isn't that a
little intense for a warm-up?

00:17:11.198 --> 00:17:13.176
It's been 3 minutes now.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:17.413
My muscles are unlike those
of you ordinary people.

00:17:17.437 --> 00:17:21.684
I don't know how to reply to
being called an ordinary person.

00:17:21.708 --> 00:17:25.254
Normal exercise won't
get my heart pumping.

00:17:25.278 --> 00:17:29.992
Much like how an F1 car will
stall out if it remains in low gear...

00:17:30.016 --> 00:17:32.314
You're really something...

00:17:41.728 --> 00:17:45.975
--A five-burst strike...!
--That must've wreaked havoc on his ribs!

00:17:45.999 --> 00:17:47.558
Did that work?!

00:17:50.437 --> 00:17:54.271
Is the world's strongest
being finally down?!

00:17:55.242 --> 00:17:58.888
--That was quick.
--But why...?

00:17:58.912 --> 00:18:02.758
Why did he let him get so near?

00:18:02.782 --> 00:18:07.897
With the Udonde, you show no opening
and let the enemy attack you,

00:18:07.921 --> 00:18:11.767
upon which you strike from a blind spot.

00:18:11.791 --> 00:18:18.407
Doppo's response was the
impenetrable Maeba Stance.

00:18:18.431 --> 00:18:21.510
If they were to find themselves
within striking distance,

00:18:21.534 --> 00:18:26.215
the first to attack would obviously
be at a great disadvantage.

00:18:26.239 --> 00:18:29.852
Yujiro's brutality reacts involuntarily.

00:18:29.876 --> 00:18:34.223
Doppo most likely knew this
and exercised patience.

00:18:34.247 --> 00:18:38.628
Moreover, he fired off five
of those Magnum-like punches!

00:18:38.652 --> 00:18:41.053
It would hurt even the Ogre...

00:18:42.989 --> 00:18:44.967
Stand up, Ogre.

00:18:44.991 --> 00:18:49.986
| know more than anyone
that you've taken no damage.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.145
He's perfectly fine...?!

00:18:56.169 --> 00:18:58.381
You're certainly tough.

00:18:58.405 --> 00:19:01.717
Almost like a beast
in the feline kingdom...

00:19:01.741 --> 00:19:07.423
That's right. You're fighting
a lion. It's not just toughness.

00:19:07.447 --> 00:19:12.578
Time to taste the pummeling of
the beast that slaughters polar bears!

00:19:21.761 --> 00:19:24.540
Hanma Yujiro has the upper hand!

00:19:24.564 --> 00:19:28.558
All Cannibal Orochi can do is block!

00:19:38.611 --> 00:19:40.875
Doppo...!

00:19:49.856 --> 00:19:51.620
Interesting!

00:20:02.068 --> 00:20:06.682
Incredible! Orochi has
dodged all of his attacks!

00:20:06.706 --> 00:20:08.951
--The Sangan!
--Sangan...?

00:20:08.975 --> 00:20:11.687
A legendary technique invented
by monks in ancient India

00:20:11.711 --> 00:20:17.760
to repel countless numbers of arrows
coming from all directions!

00:20:17.784 --> 00:20:23.432
What's wrong, Ogre?
Your "beast pummeling” has stopped...

00:20:23.456 --> 00:20:28.237
That was fun. But it's
still a human technique.

00:20:28.261 --> 00:20:31.073
Don't underestimate human techniques.

00:20:31.097 --> 00:20:38.080
Karate is a combat form perfected
by people over several millennia.

00:20:38.104 --> 00:20:41.074
Now it's your turn
to experience tradition!

00:20:42.042 --> 00:20:44.253
Matsuo-san...

00:20:44.277 --> 00:20:46.422
Please get up...!

00:20:46.446 --> 00:20:48.457
Go forth.

00:20:48.481 --> 00:20:52.315
Do you not have a reason to do so...?

00:20:56.222 --> 00:20:59.852
Thanks, Matsuo-san!
You're the best attendant ever!

00:21:08.234 --> 00:21:09.779
Why can't I dodge?!

00:21:09.803 --> 00:21:13.983
I have polished these striking
attacks every day for 50 long years!

00:21:14.007 --> 00:21:17.966
Not even a beast's reflexes can keep up!

00:21:27.153 --> 00:21:28.382
Baki!

00:21:42.168 --> 00:21:43.579
Orochi Doppo...

00:21:43.603 --> 00:21:47.516
You've done well to train this far,
to build up this far...

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:51.204
| bestow upon you my highest praise!

00:21:56.049 --> 00:21:59.128
What... is that...?

00:21:59.152 --> 00:22:02.247
Good luck... Doppo Orochi...

00:22:44.497 --> 00:22:50.045
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.069 --> 00:22:55.651
hangs onto love
in one corner of the pavement

00:22:55.675 --> 00:23:01.323
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.347 --> 00:23:06.328
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.352 --> 00:23:11.867
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:11.891 --> 00:23:17.406
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:23.078
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.102 --> 00:23:28.617
but they will be reborn

00:23:28.641 --> 00:23:34.290
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.314 --> 00:23:41.345
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:49.729 --> 00:23:50.172
"Next Episode”

00:23:50.196 --> 00:23:51.664
"Next Episode”

00:23:56.736 --> 00:24:00.549
The origin of the name
"Ogre" is unveiled.

00:24:00.573 --> 00:24:05.387
The battle over life and pride
is carved into the boy's heart.

00:24:05.411 --> 00:24:09.325
Through a breach of fear,
a red devil whispers.

00:24:09.349 --> 00:24:12.061
One that saves- and destroys- people.

00:24:12.085 --> 00:24:14.730
The boy's new challenger.

00:24:14.754 --> 00:24:19.658
"Next Episode: God of War, God of Death”
